## Methodology Pointer

This project uses the stage-gate methodology defined in:
- [`wiki/config/methodology.yaml`](wiki/config/methodology.yaml) — stages, task types, modes, end conditions
- [`wiki/config/sdlc-profile.yaml`](wiki/config/sdlc-profile.yaml) — `{{sdlc_profile}}` profile (project tier)
- [`wiki/config/domain-profile.yaml`](wiki/config/domain-profile.yaml) — `{{domain_profile}}` profile (gate-command + path-pattern overrides)
- [`wiki/config/methodology-profile.yaml`](wiki/config/methodology-profile.yaml) — `{{methodology_profile}}` profile (process style)

The agent MUST follow the work loop defined in the methodology profile. Stage boundaries are hard. ALLOWED/FORBIDDEN outputs per stage are enforced.

